# bundle_name|gradle_project|loom_refmap
# Minecraft 26.3's in-house server mods, selected like the mod list
# (mc_local_mods_manifest in scripts/lib.sh). "-" in the refmap column: the
# project builds with Loom's non-remapping plugin, so the jar carries no
# refmap and the gate checks its classes alone. gradle_project is the Gradle
# root; the jar is the one named <bundle_name stem>-*.jar under any build/libs.
customdimensions.jar|custom-dimensions-26|-
